<title>TURKEY: Turkey plans $2 bln bond issues in 1997--minister.</title>
<headline>Turkey plans $2 bln bond issues in 1997--minister.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey is planning to issue bonds worth about $2 billion in international financial markets in 1997, State Minister Ufuk Soylemez said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
